Sequence: (template, generate, link)
- Fill in HTML templates
- Generate pages
- Link pages and fill out index pages


- /pages		# stores the posts and stuff
- /docs			# compile target
- /template		# stores the structure of the website
- /assets		# stores importable snippets of HTML


{{ file_to_pull_from.html }} <- insert for HTML

--- METADATA ---
TITLE: name for file, links, etc.
ALTTITLE*: (title) alternative for sublinks if title too long
TEMPLATE*: (/template.html for that folder) template to insert text into
SUBTITLE: subtitle for posts and for the page
PATH: [path to section, e.g. /basilisk-devlog]
    ->  this is where it will put the newly generated page AND where it will
        search for the index.html to put the link into
DATE: when it was posted
SERIES: what collection it should be part of for the purposes of previous/next

*optional, default indicated in brackets
